WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.101 --> 00:00:17.242
seven Gildongs were brought to the king.

2
00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:22.184
"Which of you is the real Hong Gildong?"

3
00:00:22.665 --> 00:00:23.505
the king asked.

4
00:00:23.525 --> 00:00:27.126
"I am, Your Majesty," one said.

5
00:00:27.146 --> 00:00:30.548
"No, I am, Your Majesty," another said.

6
00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:35.129
"You're too ugly to be me," a third said to the second.

7
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.491
The second Gildong turned red.

8
00:00:38.511 --> 00:00:41.312
"How dare you insult me in front of the king!"

9
00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:46.354
The seven Gildongs all shouted at each other.

10
00:00:51.496 --> 00:00:52.497
the king yelled.

11
00:00:52.517 --> 00:00:56.819
"Chief Heup, you've seen Gildong before.

12
00:00:57.759 --> 00:00:59.300
Which is the real one?"

13
00:01:01.664 --> 00:01:03.565
Heup inspected the Gildongs.

14
00:01:03.585 --> 00:01:06.967
"Nice to see you again!"

15
00:01:07.447 --> 00:01:07.988
one said.

16
00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:09.649
Another grinned.

17
00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.750
"Have I caused you too much trouble?"

18
00:01:15.752 --> 00:01:18.654
"They all look the same, Your Majesty," Heup said.

19
00:01:20.055 --> 00:01:21.195
The king frowned.

20
00:01:21.215 --> 00:01:24.998
"Certainly his father would know.

21
00:01:26.038 --> 00:01:28.720
Chief Heup, bring Lord Hong here!"

22
00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:35.674
The Gildongs grew quiet when Lord Hong appeared.

23
00:01:37.355 --> 00:01:39.917
He seemed to be in pain as he bowed to the king.

24
00:01:39.937 --> 00:01:43.220
"Your Majesty," he said.

25
00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:48.243
"Since my lowborn son left home, I have been sick with worry.

26
00:01:49.764 --> 00:01:52.226
Now I have little time left to live.

27
00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.487
But I am here to serve you."

28
00:01:54.507 --> 00:01:57.990
"Then prove your loyalty.

29
00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.872
Tell me which one is real!"

30
00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.321
the king shouted.

31
00:02:02.341 --> 00:02:06.184
Heup led Lord Hong to the Gildongs.

32
00:02:09.547 --> 00:02:11.208
But all seven were identical.

33
00:02:15.892 --> 00:02:17.534
Lord Hong shook with fear.

34
00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:20.896
"I'm sorry, Your Majesty.

35
00:02:21.917 --> 00:02:24.199
I cannot tell which is the real Gildong."

36
00:02:24.219 --> 00:02:28.203
"How can you not know your own child?"

37
00:02:28.683 --> 00:02:29.684
the king roared.

38
00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:34.538
"Your lowborn boy has done terrible crimes.

39
00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:39.520
When I find the real Gildong, I'll punish you both!"

40
00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:45.862
At this, Lord Hong collapsed.

41
00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:48.403
The Gildongs rushed over to Lord Hong.

42
00:02:49.604 --> 00:02:52.685
They each took medicine from their sleeves and gave it to him.

43
00:02:55.846 --> 00:02:59.128
Soon his eyes opened, and he looked at them with sadness.

44
00:03:01.044 --> 00:03:03.285
Palace guards took Lord Hong away.

45
00:03:09.608 --> 00:03:11.868
sorry," a Gildong called out.

46
00:03:11.888 --> 00:03:13.869
"Quiet, you!"

47
00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.591
Heup growled, kicking the Gildong.

48
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:22.553
Poof! The Gildong turned into a straw figure.

49
00:03:23.873 --> 00:03:25.594
Everyone in the courtyard gasped.

50
00:03:25.694 --> 00:03:30.356
"Now there's six left," the king said.

51
00:03:31.476 --> 00:03:32.977
"Find the real one!"

52
00:03:34.217 --> 00:03:36.438
Heup kicked another Gildong hard.

53
00:03:37.578 --> 00:03:39.879
Poof! That one turned to straw too.

54
00:03:39.899 --> 00:03:43.320
He kicked the Gildongs one by one.

55
00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.821
Each one turned to straw.

56
00:03:48.621 --> 00:03:51.402
Finally Heup reached the last Gildong.

57
00:03:52.042 --> 00:03:53.883
He took out his sword and grinned.

58
00:03:53.903 --> 00:03:56.864
"Your crimes end now!"

59
00:03:58.552 --> 00:04:01.473
Gildong smiled as a strong wind blew.

60
00:04:02.433 --> 00:04:03.874
He shot into the air.

61
00:04:05.034 --> 00:04:05.834
Heup looked up.

62
00:04:07.035 --> 00:04:09.915
Gildong was floating on a cloud above the crowd.

63
00:04:09.935 --> 00:04:13.236
"Chief Heup, get him!"

64
00:04:13.557 --> 00:04:14.377
the king ordered.

65
00:04:14.397 --> 00:04:17.598
"Archers!" Heup cried.

66
00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:24.420
your arrows!"
